# The image build reads only these files (see the COPY lines in
# .devcontainer/Dockerfile), so the build context is an allowlist. The context is
# the repo root; without this, .git, .env and every build artefact are sent to
# the builder on each build. Add a line here when the Dockerfile COPYs more.
*
!flake.nix
!flake.lock
!.devcontainer/env.nix

# OPTIONAL: uncomment with the sshd COPY in the Dockerfile. Without it that COPY
# fails, because the file is not in the context.
# !.devcontainer/sshd/10-devbox.conf
